sequenceDiagram
    participant UA as User A (Flutter)
    participant WS as ElysiaJS WebSocket
    participant DB as Neon DB
    participant UB as User B (Flutter)

    Note over UA,UB: ── Both users connect to same bill room ──

    UA->>WS: WS connect /ws/bills/:id
    WS->>WS: subscribe room "bill:id"
    WS-->>UA: connected ✓

    UB->>WS: WS connect /ws/bills/:id
    WS->>WS: subscribe room "bill:id"
    WS-->>UB: connected ✓

    Note over UA,UB: ── User A adds a new item ──

    UA->>UA: optimistic update (show item immediately)
    UA->>WS: send {type:"add_item", payload:{name:"ผัดไทย", unit_price:150}}
    WS->>DB: INSERT bill_items
    DB-->>WS: item {id, name, unit_price}
    WS-->>UA: {type:"item_added", item} ← confirm
    WS-->>UB: {type:"item_added", item} ← broadcast
    UB->>UB: item appears in list live

    Note over UA,UB: ── Both assign themselves simultaneously ──

    UA->>WS: send {type:"assign_item", payload:{item_id, user_id:A}}
    UB->>WS: send {type:"assign_item", payload:{item_id, user_id:B}}

    WS->>DB: INSERT item_assigns {item_id, user_id:A}
    WS->>DB: INSERT item_assigns {item_id, user_id:B}
    DB-->>WS: both saved (shared item — no conflict)

    WS-->>UA: {type:"item_assigned", assign:{item_id, user_id:A}}
    WS-->>UB: {type:"item_assigned", assign:{item_id, user_id:A}}
    WS-->>UA: {type:"item_assigned", assign:{item_id, user_id:B}}
    WS-->>UB: {type:"item_assigned", assign:{item_id, user_id:B}}

    Note over UA,UB: Both see both avatars on the item live

    Note over UA,UB: ── User A disconnects (e.g. goes background) ──

    UA->>WS: disconnect
    WS->>WS: unsubscribe room "bill:id"
    UA->>UA: auto-reconnect after 2s (retry logic)
    UA->>WS: WS connect /ws/bills/:id
    WS->>DB: SELECT current bill state
    DB-->>WS: latest items + assigns
    WS-->>UA: {type:"sync", items, assigns} ← full state resync
